{"id": "df792ec86449d8082448bf3a22d1a8ad", "text": "Sanjaya said:  Hearing these words from Lord Keshav a, Arjuna  \nprayed  again to Krishna, shaking  with fear, with folded hands, bowed head \nin a trembling voice. (11.35)  \n \nComments:  In response to King Dhrutarashtra\u2019s curiosity about \nfurther developments in the war, Sanjaya states that Arjuna who was \nterrified  at the Lord\u2019s magnificent but frightening form starts addressing  the \nLord in a trembling voice .  As will be seen later, Arjuna is also concerned", "embedding": [-0.03441115468740463, 0.02510075457394123, 0.006407152395695448, -0.009725246578454971, -0.06120682507753372, -0.0021953254472464323, 0.06975818425416946, -0.038228489458560944, 0.06200039014220238, -0.11036182194948196, -0.059274427592754364, -0.05058347061276436, 0.06386695802211761, -0.11125916987657547, 0.011837237514555454, -0.01878928206861019, -0.040788065642118454, 0.05664850026369095, -0.015290931798517704, -0.012537209317088127, -0.02097514644265175, 0.0984104722738266, 0.03057538904249668, -0.020288068801164627, 0.0071280337870121, 0.014016281813383102, 0.010436552576720715, -0.055579476058483124, 0.037722617387771606, 0.02836676314473152, 0.00627896748483181, -0.0739620104432106, -0.04831463471055031, 0.0008991445647552609, 0.014695469290018082, 0.06944426149129868, 0.02367330901324749, 0.06068495288491249, 0.004501500632613897, -0.08446090668439865, 0.028327060863375664, 0.05376702547073364, -0.014337628148496151, -0.006300807930529118, 0.008602967485785484, -0.009443337097764015, -0.1025901809334755, -0.04059784859418869, 0.06763582676649094, -0.033858995884656906, -0.018887382000684738, -0.13570082187652588, 0.024256249889731407, -0.0605500303208828, 0.05766244977712631, -0.04009871557354927, 0.03218080475926399, -0.0052582621574401855, 0.09178312867879868, 0.04410431906580925, -0.06926877796649933, -0.002269435441121459, 0.1317579597234726, 0.06112096086144447, 0.029989687725901604, -0.07290951162576675, 0.03